    "faq_weMq9E": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "item_wxtgXi": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "1. How much incline does the Merach W50 Walking Pad offer?",
            "content": "<p>The Merach W50 Walking Pad features an automatic incline of up to 12%, which can be easily adjusted using the remote control. The incline increases workout intensity and can help you burn up to 30% more calories compared with walking on a flat surface, making it ideal for more effective home workouts.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_ipmC7L": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "2. How quiet is the Merach W50 Walking Pad during use?",
            "content": "<p>Powered by a 3.5 HP brushless motor, the Walking Pad runs extremely quietly with a noise level of around 25 dB. This makes it perfect for flats, shared homes, or home office use, allowing you to exercise without disturbing others.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_HXX7xV": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "3. What is the maximum user weight for the Merach W50 Walking Pad?",
            "content": "<p>The robust treadmill supports a maximum user weight of up to 181 kg (400 lbs). Its reinforced steel frame ensures excellent stability, making it suitable for a wide range of users.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_DkTw8N": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "4. Is the Merach W50 Walking Pad joint-friendly?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. The treadmill features a 6-layer cushioning system with a non-slip running belt, designed to reduce impact on the knees and ankles by up to 30%. This makes it ideal for daily walking, beginners, or low-impact training at home.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_gm8BdE": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "5. How wide is the running surface on the Merach W50 Walking Pad?",
            "content": "<p>The Walking Pad includes an extra-wide 42 cm running belt, providing greater stability and safety while walking. The wider surface allows for a more comfortable and natural stride compared with many compact under-desk treadmills.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_fTHWjV": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "6. Can the Merach W50 Walking Pad be used in the office or under a desk?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. Its compact design makes the W50 ideal as an under-desk treadmill for the office or home office. Built-in transport wheels allow you to move it easily, while the LED display shows key workout data such as time, distance, speed and calories.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
